"to_stem": "The period for x''+ω²x=0 is",
"choices_md5": "d914ee7f2b0343195f5419dce39bcd74"
},
{
"version_id": "b7f33d69-7a41-42ba-9455-eb46472604f3",
"content_key": "apphycm-mcq-019",
"from_md5": "39bfa1446adc286eb8838182c3a0c7d2",
"to_stem": "For τ(t)=τ₀t acting on constant I, change in angular speed from 0 to T is",
"choices_md5": "904b819910e0d42032d372c0735a9f3d"
},
{
"version_id": "f415f38a-4f86-4254-92a2-51b3687c44d5",
"content_key": "apphycm-mcq-020",
"from_md5": "364ea7c84bcb7ee551ae4256eb93752d",
"to_stem": "For a physical pendulum undergoing small-angle oscillation, omega^2 equals which of the following, where d is the distance from the pivot to the center of mass and I is the moment of inertia about the pivot?",
"choices_md5": "d85fe20fd96141ab854796a03218bebf"
},
{
"version_id": "5e75e2b8-cfe6-4f8d-bec9-324d66ccd696",
