"from_md5": "3626ad56ffb390103fe0c7bf6135618e",
"to_stem": "A force F₀e^{-t/τ} acts from t=0 to infinity. Its impulse is",
"choices_md5": "83b30ef5a4fc1ba7cb1f5ac76446be63"
},
{
"version_id": "ba498b18-fcc5-4323-977c-89cd83878f89",
"content_key": "apphycm-mcq-033",
"from_md5": "e767759a382b888b2c046f16a47e93e6",
"to_stem": "For a system of total mass M, total momentum is",
"choices_md5": "236f9b92793df9715723e3ee00be1f6c"
},
{
"version_id": "ba6e8551-c83d-4c81-8844-09674b2f42cc",
"content_key": "apphycm-mcq-034",
"from_md5": "746a970c821cbf46414cad0a852c032e",
"to_stem": "In an isolated perfectly inelastic collision,",
